{
  "id": "p49",
  "title": "The Hostel in the Old Post Office",
  "titleZh": "旧邮局里的旅舍",
  "topic": "旧邮局旅舍与酒牌争议",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "The grand old post office now hosts a small youth hostel.",
        "zh": "那座宏伟的旧邮局如今经营着一家小型青年旅舍。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Its seventieth year brings a bid for a new lease.",
        "zh": "它的第七十周年带来了一份新租约的投标。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A young candidate submits a careful application for the plan.",
        "zh": "一位年轻候选人提交了一份仔细的计划申请。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then the plan simply adds an alcohol licence and a night cafe.",
        "zh": "然后这项计划只是增加了一张酒牌和一家夜间咖啡馆。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Some neighbours appeal the decision and demand a defence of it.",
        "zh": "一些邻居对决定提出上诉，并要求为其辩护。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin, a specialist, explains the rules to interested guests.",
        "zh": "我的表姐是一位专家，向感兴趣的客人解释规则。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My aunt's editorial calls the whole scheme a corporate grab.",
        "zh": "我姑姑的社论把整个方案称为企业掠夺。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Her argument draws an intense reaction from the town council.",
        "zh": "她的论点在镇议会引来了强烈反应。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A mask and a painted vessel hang in the front room.",
        "zh": "一张面具和一只彩绘容器挂在前面房间里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The exhibition explores the shadow side of the old postal service.",
        "zh": "展览探讨旧邮政服务阴暗的一面。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "An original poster quotes a letter about the building's status.",
        "zh": "一张原来的海报引用了一封关于这栋建筑地位的信。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Few guests identify the button that once rang a bell.",
        "zh": "很少有客人认出那只曾经按响铃的按钮。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A circuit of small rooms fills the old postal complex.",
        "zh": "一圈小房间填满了旧邮政综合体。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then soft shade from paper lamps makes the dining room romantic.",
        "zh": "然后纸灯柔和的阴影让餐厅变得浪漫。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The kitchen serves a plain diet and keeps a sack of flour.",
        "zh": "厨房供应简单的饮食，并存放一袋面粉。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A junior chef learns to behave calmly under pressure.",
        "zh": "一位初级厨师学会在压力下平静行事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One amazing dish wins recognition from a food magazine.",
        "zh": "一道惊人的菜赢得了一份美食杂志的认可。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later a local subsidy helps cover the cost of new net curtains.",
        "zh": "后来一项本地补贴帮助支付了新网帘的费用。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The owners mount a photo wall and spin each story with care.",
        "zh": "业主们装了一面照片墙，并小心地讲述每个故事。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They ought to test the plan, apart from the noise question.",
        "zh": "除了噪音问题，他们应该测试这项计划。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "Their current income is unlikely to cover a second year.",
        "zh": "他们目前的收入不太可能支撑第二年。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A larger proportion of guests prefer the quiet back rooms.",
        "zh": "更大比例的客人更喜欢安静的后屋。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The owners sacrifice a small garden for a long-held desire.",
        "zh": "业主们牺牲一个小花园，换取一个长久以来的愿望。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Amid the noise, the council offers one small concession.",
        "zh": "在喧闹声中，议会给出了一点小小的让步。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The deal includes a testing period for the new establishment.",
        "zh": "这笔交易包括对新机构的一段测试期。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A drama group naturally performs in the old hall.",
        "zh": "一个剧团自然地在旧大厅里演出。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The council's decision rests on nerve and a fair account.",
        "zh": "议会的决定取决于勇气和一份公正的账目。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother calls the latter rule controversial and designed to victimize.",
        "zh": "我母亲称后一条规则有争议，而且意在使人受害。"
      }
    ]
  ],
